const cafeSounds=[['rain','窗外小雨'],['wind','輕風吹過'],['ocean','緩慢海浪'],['brown','柔和棕噪音'],['white','細緻白噪音']];
function cafeSoundSamples(kind,rate,seconds=20){const data=new Float32Array(Math.round(rate*seconds));let brown=0,soft=0;for(let i=0;i<data.length;i++){const t=i/rate,w=Math.random()*2-1;brown=(brown+0.018*w)/1.018;soft+=0.1*(w-soft);let value;if(kind==='white')value=w;else if(kind==='brown')value=brown;else if(kind==='wind')value=brown*(0.7+0.15*Math.sin(2*Math.PI*t/10)+0.1*Math.sin(2*Math.PI*t/5));else if(kind==='ocean'){const wave=(1-Math.cos(2*Math.PI*t/10))/2;value=(soft*0.3+brown*0.8)*(0.25+0.75*wave)}else value=(w*0.3+soft*0.7)*(0.86+0.06*Math.sin(2*Math.PI*t/10));data[i]=value}
// Sparse distant drops instead of a steady downpour.
if(kind==='rain')for(let n=0;n<seconds*3;n++){const start=Math.floor(Math.random()*(data.length-rate*0.08)),freq=600+Math.random()*1000;for(let j=0;j<rate*0.06;j++)data[start+j]+=0.12*Math.sin(2*Math.PI*freq*j/rate)*Math.exp(-j/(rate*0.012))}
let sum=0,peak=0;for(const x of data){sum+=x*x;peak=Math.max(peak,Math.abs(x))}const target=kind==='rain'?0.075:0.1,scale=Math.min(target/Math.sqrt(sum/data.length),0.6/(peak||1));const fade=Math.round(rate*0.012);for(let i=0;i<data.length;i++)data[i]*=scale*Math.min(1,i/fade,(data.length-1-i)/fade);return data}
function setupCafeSounds(){let context=null,source=null,master=null,alive=true,generation=0,kind=cafeSounds.some(x=>x[0]===state.cafe.sound)?state.cafe.sound:'rain';const selection=$('#cafeSoundType'),button=$('#cafeSound'),volume=$('#cafeVolume'),status=$('#cafeSoundStatus');selection.value=kind;volume.value=String(Math.min(0.15,Math.max(0,Number(state.cafe.soundVolume??0.04))));
function stop(){generation++;if(source){try{source.stop()}catch{}source=null}if(context){context.close().catch(()=>{});context=null}master=null;if(alive){button.textContent='播放背景聲';status.textContent='背景聲已停止。'}}
async function start(){stop();const id=generation;try{const AC=window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext;if(!AC)throw Error();const ctx=new AC();context=ctx;await ctx.resume();if(!alive||id!==generation){ctx.close().catch(()=>{});return}const samples=cafeSoundSamples(kind,ctx.sampleRate),buffer=ctx.createBuffer(1,samples.length,ctx.sampleRate);buffer.copyToChannel(samples,0);source=ctx.createBufferSource();source.buffer=buffer;source.loop=true;const low=ctx.createBiquadFilter();low.type='lowpass';low.frequency.value={rain:2600,wind:700,ocean:1800,brown:1000,white:5000}[kind];low.Q.value=0.5;const high=ctx.createBiquadFilter();high.type='highpass';high.frequency.value=kind==='rain'?250:45;high.Q.value=0.5;master=ctx.createGain();master.gain.setValueAtTime(0,ctx.currentTime);master.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(Number(volume.value),ctx.currentTime+0.5);source.connect(low);low.connect(high);high.connect(master);master.connect(ctx.destination);source.start();button.textContent='停止背景聲';status.textContent=cafeSounds.find(x=>x[0]===kind)[1]+'播放中。'}catch{if(id===generation){stop();if(alive)status.textContent='暫時無法播放背景聲，請再點一次或換個瀏覽器。'}}}
button.onclick=()=>context?stop():start();selection.onchange=()=>{const wasPlaying=!!context;kind=selection.value;state.cafe.sound=kind;persist();if(wasPlaying)start()};volume.oninput=()=>{const v=Number(volume.value);state.cafe.soundVolume=v;persist();if(master&&context)master.gain.setTargetAtTime(v,context.currentTime,0.08)};return ()=>{alive=false;stop()}}
